# Alt+F and Alt+B move the caret by word, so a word can be inserted in the middle of a task.
file <<END
- Buy milk today
END
see Buy milk today
keys <Enter> <Home> <A-f>
type  oat
keys <A-b> <A-b>
type fresh
keys <Space>
keys <Esc>
see - fresh Buy oat milk today
quit
saved <<END
- fresh Buy oat milk today
END
